window.products.push({"id":115186,"name":"EVERYTHRY Dryer Repair Kit for Samsung Dryer Belt Kit Include DC97-16782A Drum Roller, DC93-00634A Idler Pulley and 6602-001655 Drum Belt Replace for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rmo23xyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Samsung Belt Maintenance Kit DC97-16782A Drum Roller, 6602-001655 Drive Belt, and DC93-00634A Idler Pulley. DC97-16782A drum support roller and axle which includes the roller shaft and mounting clips. This part holds the drum as it rotates on the support wheels. When the roller begins to wear out, it is self-lubricated, so don't need additional grease. Premium quality rubber without any odors keeps your dryer drum turning smoothly. If your dryer is making odd noises, checking and replacing the rollers can be the solution to your problem. DC93-00634A Idler pulley includes the idler arm and the idler pulley that maintains tension on the drive belt, allowing the belt to turn. Work silently and smoothly. Disconnect the power before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. 6602-001655 dryer drum belt is made of black rubber, attaches to the motor pulley, and causes the drum to spin as the motor is rotating. When this part breaks, your dryer won’t work as it should. Fix the following problems: 1. Noisy dryer 2. Dryer won’t start 3. Dryer won’t tumble 4. Dryer doesn’t heat at all 5. Dryer doesn’t produce enough heat Installation Tips: Make sure to unplug the dryer from the power source before beginning the replacement! Before installing, watching a related tutorial on YouTube that will help you find out how to fix it. If you don't find the model you want, please feel free to email us! This is not a Samsung OEM product. The above of using the Samsung brand name or model designation is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rmo23xyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVERYTHRY","source_asin":"B08DY3HWZG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DY3HWZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DY3HWZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
