window.products.push({"id":115355,"name":"NEWCOMDIGI Protect Your Samsung Gas Range with Non-Stick Stove Covers (0.5mm Thick) and Oven Liner - Compatible, Washable, and Reusable Gas Stove Burn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o0pyhwGiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Attention to Size – Please check the size of your stove carefully to ensure that it is compatible with this item. This stove cover is designed to fit certain Samsung model gas stoves, but not all of them. If you have a gas stove that is not a Samsung model, you will need to purchase a different item. It is important to note that the stove covers may not fit your stove perfectly, and some adjustments may be necessary, such as cutting, to ensure a proper fit. Gas Stove Compatibility – Fit for Samsung model FX510BGS/XAA NX58F5500SB/AA NX58F5500SS/AA NX58F5500SW/AA NX58H5600SS/AA NX58H5650WS/AA NX58J5600SG/AA NX58J7750SG/AA NX58J7750SS/AA NX58K3310SB/AA NX58K3310SS/AA NX58K3310SW/AA NX58K7850SG/AA NX58K7850SS/AA NX58M5600SB/AA NX58M5600SW/AA NX58R4311SG/AA NX58R4311SS/AA NX58R5601SG/AA NX58R5601SS/AA NX58T5601SB/AA NX58T5601SW/AA NX58T7511SG/AA NX58T7511SS/AA NX583G0VBBB/AA NX583G0VBSR/AA NX583G0VBWW/AA Stove Cover for Samsung Gas Range - Our upgraded stove cover is made of food-grade, smudge-resistant silicone that meets FDA standards and is free from harmful chemicals like BPA and PFOA. It is not only environmentally friendly but also hygienic. This stove cover can withstand heat up to 570° C without melting or burning easily, making it perfect for use on Samsung gas ranges. The installation process is quick and easy - simply pull it out of the package and place it on your stovetop. Excellent 2-Pack Gap Covers - Our stove gap covers are designed to help you say goodbye to the difficult-to-clean gunk and debris that can accumulate in the gap between your stove and countertop, or any other household appliances. With this pack of 2 stove gap covers, it's easy to trim them to fit your stove and counter's unique dimensions using a household scissor. The result is a customized and perfect fit that not only looks great but also makes cleaning a breeze. FDA standards Oven Liner - Our oven liner meets FDA standards and is free from harmful chemicals like lead and cadmium, as confirmed by independent testing. Reusable and easy to clean, it's perfect for use as a protective grill mat, baking sheet, or pan liner in electric and gas ovens, microwaves, stoves, toasters, grills, and more. Plus, it's highly heat-resistant and won't melt easily. Cook with confidence knowing our FDA-approved oven liner keeps your kitchen clean and safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o0pyhwGiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWCOMDIGI","source_asin":"B0B5SSPN1F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5SSPN1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5SSPN1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
