window.products.push({"id":115507,"name":"WR57X10051 Refrigerator Dual Water Inlet Valve - Replacement for GE Hot-point Ken-more Refrigerator - Suitable for Dual Inlet riv-12ae21 AP3672839 WR5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61haLxFMmfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT SPECIFICATION】:WR57X10051 Refrigerator double water inlet valve is suitable for the refrigerator with ice and water. The WR57X10051 refrigerator water valve has 2 solenoid valves and quick plug connectors, one to allow water to enter the ice maker and the other to allow water to enter the dispenser. The blue coil has 3/16 \"male terminals and the red coil has 1/4\" male terminals. The WR57X10051 adds a plastic case to the power connection for greater protection and durability. ✅【APPLICABLE SYMPTOMS】: Includes 1 x WR57X10051 refrigerator double water inlet valve. The WR57X10051 refrigerator inlet water valve is made of high quality metal and abs material to ensure its durability. WR57X10051 Refrigerator double water inlet valve can solve the refrigerator leakage, ice maker does not make ice, no water, ice maker does not make ice and other symptoms. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】:The WR57X10051 refrigerator double water inlet valve supports 365 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, if you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】:WR57X10051 Refrigerator double water inlet valve supports can replacement for G-E Hot-point Ken-more refrigerator. Replaces Numbers: 1032629,AP3672839, PS901314, AH901314, EAP901314, WR57X0099, WR57X0104, WR57X0111, WR57X0119, WR57X10010,WR57X10012,WR57X10018,WR57X10018E,WR57X104,TPX24BRYAWW,TPX24SRYABS,TFX24ZFSAAD,TFX24ZFSAWH,etc. If you are not sure whether the machine is suitable for you, please contact us and we will be happy to help you. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】: WR57X10051 refrigerator double feed valve to supply water to ice maker and water dispenser. If you don't know how to install it or use it, you can learn more through the online video, which is very easy and convenient. The new valve features a new quick connection. Cut the existing nuts from the existing plastic water pipe and push them into the new valve. To remove them, press down on the ring into which the tube slipped.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61haLxFMmfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0892BNSSZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892BNSSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892BNSSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
