window.products.push({"id":115637,"name":"ET-LIXIN Portable Folding Washing Machine For Socks Underwear Mini washer For Outdoor RV (PINK)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51isQEhixWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's just a low power mini washing machine, only for small items! If you don't like it Please select the reason for return: \"Unwanted item\" but not \"defective\"!!! thank you.Product Usage Scenarios: ET-LIXIN Folding washing machine is a compact, portable versatile and eco-friendly washing machine. As the Family’s 2nd washing machine,It is for washing small and delicate items, such as baby clothes, underwear, towels, bras, socks, soft toys and reusable face masks. The innovative foldable design makes it easy to fit in small spaces which is ideal for people living in limited spaces like student apartment、RV.You don’t have to use shared laundry after got this foldable mini washer. The Parameters Of The Product: After drawing size:11x11x9.5 inches; After folding size:11x11x4.5 inches; Rated input voltage:100-240V; OUTPUT:12V/2.5A ； Rated Power:10W; Gross Weight:3.1LB; Washing Capacity:4.5L(Reference for each amount of laundry:3-4 pair of socks;2-3 pairs of underwear;1-2 baby clothes;2-3 bras.) What in the box: Washing machine *1;The adapter plugs *1;English instruction manual *1. English instruction manual. The Disadvantages About This Product: 1.Underpowered: the power rating of the product is only 10 watt, so it is not suitable for sweater, jeans, coats and other big clothes, not a substitute for large washing machine. 2. No draining function: this product cannot automatically drain water, so it needs to be poured out manually after washing. 3. No spin-drying function:Since it is a mini washing machine with very low power, all folding washing machines cannot dry wet clothes, so we canceled the spin-drying function. Despite these shortcomings, this product can still solve some problems for some people who do not want to wash their clothes by hand .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51isQEhixWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ET-LIXIN","source_asin":"B09MFL77XF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MFL77XF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MFL77XF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
