window.products.push({"id":115644,"name":"66 x 25 mm WHITE Perforated Shrink Band for Growler Bottles, Pharmaceutical Bottles, Gallon Jugs, Honey Bottles, and More. Fits 1 1/4\" to 1 1/2\" Diame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yxN3SmFDL._AC_.jpg","description":"What you are purchasing here are 66 by 25mm (Layflat Dimensions) tamper seal shrink bands that work best for growler bottles, pharmaceutical bottles, gallon jugs, honey bottles and various other types of containers . Directions: Place shrink band around the lid of the bottle that you will be shrinking it to. Apply heat with the use of a heat gun or heat tunnel. I don't recommend using a blow dryer; it's possible but not worth it unless you're only doing a small quantity of bottles. The shrink bands are easy to heat and durable. Have any questions at all about the shrink bands? Just send me a message and I'll get back to you as soon as I can!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yxN3SmFDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supplement and Supply","source_asin":"B07CQ9WZ11","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CQ9WZ11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CQ9WZ11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":115645,"name":"ICEPURE PLUS UKF8001 NSF53 Certified Replacement for Everydrop EDR4RXD1, Whirlpool Filter 4, Maytag UKF8001AXX-200, MPF15090, WF-UKF8001, Puriclean II","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p1L7My11S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✤【Authoritative Certifications】：NSF/ANSI 53,42 & 372 Lead-Free by NSF, IAPMO, European Food Grade Regulations EC-1935/2016, ROHS, REACH, BPA-Free, TUV and Australian Water Mark, Produced under quality systems ISO9001/ ISO14000. And under the supervision of the three major American authoritiesIAPMO, NSF, and WQA. For higher filtering levels (NSF/ANSI 401 certified), please search for ASIN: B08R8XG7F1 ✤【Excellent Filtration Effect】The filtering effect of this product is extremely well, which can remove many kinds of harmful impurities in the water. Certified by NSF/ANSI 42 can remove Chlorine, Bad Taste, Organic Compounds, Odor, Particulate Class I, Rust, and other solid particles. Certified by NSF/ANSI 53 can remove Cysts, Lead, Heavy metal impurities, etc. Effectively removing heavy metal impurities in the water is the most notable feature of this water filter. ✤【100% Match & No-Leakage】ICEPURE water filter using advanced fully automated industrial technology, The measurement technology is accurate to microns. Withstood thousands of water hammer tests, the current production process is very mature and rigorous. Installation is simple and requires no tools(With detailed installation steps). Perfectly matching the original model and no worry about leaking. ✤【Premium Filter Materials】:Top coconut shell activated carbon Certified by NSF. Unlike some low-end filtration products that use coal-based activated carbon and apricot shell activated carbon, All the products of ICEPURE filter material are 100% selected coconut shell activated carbon, which has a larger specific surface area, more micropores, and more clean. ✤【Compatible Models】Maytag UKF8001 Water Filter, UKF8001P, UKF8001AXX, UKF8001AXX-200, UKF9001, Whirlpool EDR4RXD1 Filter 4, 469005, 4396395, PUR, 9006, 469006-750, 67003591, 9084, 4609084, UKF8001-750, PURICLEAN II, HDX FMM-2, Viking RWFFR, Water drop WD UKF8001, WDS-UKF8001, AQF-UKF8001, Mist UKF8001, Onepurify RFC0900A, R9006, OWF51, Yealink WF50, WF295, SGF-M9, 67003523-750, AMZN-UKF8001-A, K&J UKF8001, 46-9992, 12589203, GI6FDRXXY07, KBFS25ETSS01, W10181835.ICEPURE is an independent brand. ✤【Fit Models】ICEPURE RWF0900A, RFC0900A, GOLDEN, OnePurify RFC 0900A, EcoBlueLife EBL7770, Aqua Fresh WF295, FilterLogic FL-RF07, Pure Line PL-400, PL400, EcoAqua EFF-6007A, Mist CWMF004, HDX FMM2, Refresh R-9006, R9006, More Pure Filters MPF15090, Crystala Filters CF5, Clear Choice CLCH101, Tier1 RWF1040, Swift Green SGF-M10, Pure Green PG-8001, K&J Freshflow 4, Dista Filter DWF-9, Water drop WD-UKF8001, AQUACREST AQF-UKF8001, Waterspecialist WS607B, Maxblue MB-UKF8001-P,GLACIER FRESH GF-8001. ✤【Food-Grade Material】Certified by NSF/ANSI 372, which ensures the filter is lead-free. Food grade material， BPA-Free. Choose ICEPURE, Choose a more assured lifestyle! ✤【 Great Value for Money】It is a great way to have a healthy and clean source of drinking water but can not worry about your budget. From now on, you won’t need to spend money on bottled water. Stay away from the invasion of plastic particles on our bodies and save money at the same time! We can say that this is a very effective refrigerator filter, which will also give you incredible value for your money. ✤【 Long Serve Life】ICEPURE refrigerator water’s ability to remove Chlorine after testing 600 Gallons of water in the laboratory is still 99%. But in order to ensure that we can always drink clean and fresh water, we highly recommend replacing it every 6 months or 300 gallons of water filtered. It also depends on the water quality and the amount of water being filtered. Lots of users are impressed by its longevity and durability. ✤【Quality Assurance】ICEPURE is an American company. Our factory has been producing high-quality filtration products for 20+ years. A number of products have obtained the authority certification issued by WQA, NSF401, NSF473, NSF58, NSF53, NSF42, and NSF372 certification. 24 hours/7 days customer service, ICEPURE is committed to providing high-quality after-sales protection!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p1L7My11S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEPURE","source_asin":"B012V6DT8A","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012V6DT8A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B012V6DT8A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
