window.products.push({"id":115914,"name":"KreAid 200 Pack Aluminum Foils Lids Compatible with Nespresso VertuoLine Capsules to Reuse Vertuoline Coffee Pods Cover Seals Refillable Pods Reusable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o3PWctvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕️【Get the Wide Compatibility】Refill and reuse your Vertuoline Nespresso capsules in less than 60 seconds! The aluminum foil seals are specially designed for vertuo coffee capsules that fit for Nespresso VertuoLine machines. Not Compatible with Nespresso Original Line machine. 💰【Designed Value for Money】The diameter of these foil lids is 60 mm, and they usually have a pull tab for easy opening. Perfect Fit aluminum foil seals are expertly designed with precise dimensions to match Vertuoline Nespresso pods without covering up the barcode underneath. ☕️【Easy Press in Sheerness】The gauge of the foil is around 2.5 μm, and each lid is normally embossed with KreAId.These foil seals are made with extra-thick, food-grade aluminum foil, which won't ever rip during brewing no mess. ♻【Effective Solution for Recycle 】Switch to refilled with aluminum foil lids in Coffee maker, You extend the life of Coffee Capsules with this simple, eco-friendly DIYmethod at Home. Now you can enjoy a creamy cup of coffee with your favorite blend and reduce waste in the process. There is nothing to go in the landfill. 🏆【Package Included】200 PCS coffee capsules aluminum foil seals for Nesspressso Vertuoline pods Nespresso vertuo refillable pods. (Tips: Nespresso Vertuoline Capsules are not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o3PWctvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KreAid","source_asin":"B0B314LGZH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B314LGZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B314LGZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
