window.products.push({"id":115916,"name":"Waterdrop RPWF Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® RPWF, RWF1063, RWF3600A, WSG-4, DWF-36, R-3600, MPF15350, OPFG3-RF300, WF277, 3 Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QYdSmaZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Waterdrop refrigerator filter, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this filter is effective against various impurities. 【Advanced filtration process】If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter effectively filters off impurities from your water. These include heavy metals, chlorine, copper, cadmium, VOCs, chromium, THM, and other suspended particles tested by the third-party laboratory. While the impurities are reduced, every beneficial mineral in your water is kept, ensuring that your body functions properly. 【Complimentary month install stickers】You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 300 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions. 【BPA-free and food-grade materials】At Waterdrop, we prioritize your safety. This is why we have used only safe materials in this refrigerator filter, as verified by the NSF 372 certification for lead-free materials. 【Replacement for models】GE RPWF, Odoga RPWF, MORE Pure Filters MPF15350, Dista DWF-36, Refresh R-3600, EXCELPURE EP-RPWF, WaterSentinel WSG-4, Zuma Filter RPWF, Tier1 RWF1063, EXCELPURE EP-RPWF. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QYdSmaZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01CC7SBAY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-115916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CC7SBAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CC7SBAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
